# GitDependencies exclusions for a macOS (Apple Silicon) TITAN build of UE 5.8.4.
# One --exclude=<value> per line. Matching rules verified against
# Engine/Source/Programs/GitDependencies/Program.cs (IsExcludedFolder):
#   "Name"  -> excludes any path containing the folder /Name/ (case-insensitive)
#   "/A/B"  -> excludes paths starting with /A/B/
# Re-running GitDependencies without a line restores those files.

# Other platforms and their toolchains
Win64
Win32
WinArm64
Windows
HoloLens
Linux
LinuxArm64
Unix
Android
IOS
TVOS
VisionOS
VS2015
vs2017
win-x64
win-arm64
linux-x64
linux-arm64
x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu
aarch64-unknown-linux-gnueabi

# Optional MetaHuman sample content (grooms, clothing, texture synthesis); not needed to build or run the editor
/Engine/Plugins/MetaHuman/MetaHumanCharacter/Content/Optional

